# Project account map

Fill in your real accounts for **this project only** — identity only, no passwords or API keys.  
Leave a row blank or delete it if this project does not use that provider. Do not leave placeholder text as if it were a real value.

```text
Source control:   GitHub / GitLab / Bitbucket           →
Hosting/Deploy:   Vercel / Netlify / Railway / Render    →
Database/BaaS:    Supabase / Firebase / PlanetScale / Neon →
Cloud:            AWS / GCP / Azure                      →
CDN/Edge:         Cloudflare                              →
```

Before creating or changing external resources, verify the logged-in CLI/console account matches this map.  
If a category is blank, treat it as **unverified** — confirm the correct account with the user before modifying that provider.

Never hard-code these values into application source code.
